@@ -3,3 +3,4 @@
 ## Unreleased
 - Faster large imports: quicker timestamp parsing and row hashing, a persistent warehouse connection, and the next chunk is parsed while the previous one is posting. Posted rows are unchanged.
 - vendor_b imports now accept UTF-8 exports (with or without a BOM) as well as Windows-1252; the encoding is detected per file.
+- When an order appears more than once in a file (e.g. vendor_a re-sending a corrected order), the latest row now wins instead of the first. The kept row is posted at the position of its last occurrence.
